5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"We need to fix the fee structure. Costs have shifted, and we must decide how to handle it fairly for everyone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Fairness is easy to say, hard to collect. I’d like to understand the actual workload before we pick a method.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I’d like to see how uneven the actual usage is. Who is really carrying the weight, and who is barely there?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The hesitation at the door is real. We need a structure that makes showing up feel natural, not like a transaction.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shunichi"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shunichi: The hesitation at the door is real. We need a structure that makes showing up feel natural, not like a transaction.""}]}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I refuse to guess. We need hard numbers on what we can actually count on coming in, not just what we hope for.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, your point about workload is valid. But @Takumi, we also need to know what people actually pay. Let’s look at the data.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, agreed. But @Takumi, I suspect the ""hard numbers"" you want are buried in the administrative mess. Let’s check the ledger and the treasurer’s hours.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, the ledger shows costs, not people. I need the sign-in sheets to see who is actually here, and the rota to see who is working.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, the sign-in sheets are just numbers. I need to understand the hesitation. I’ll check the winter social feedback and the taster forms.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is just past costs. I need the bank statements to see who actually pays on time. That’s the real income.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the taster forms show why people hesitate, but I need to see the mid-year joiners. How do we handle those part-year calculations?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, part-year calculations are a nightmare. I’ll check the sign-up records to see how many we actually had to hand-work last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, the mid-year joiners are a symptom, not the cause. I need the sign-in sheets and the rota to see who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the taster forms are just surface-level. I need to see the weekday turnout to understand why people stopped treating those evenings as theirs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is useless for predicting income. I’m sticking with the bank statements. I need to know who actually pays, not just what we spent.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, the sign-up records will show the administrative burden. I’ll check the mid-year joiners and the taster forms to understand the hesitation.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, fair enough. I’ll check the treasurer’s logged hours and the bank statements. I need to know the true cost of chasing money versus collecting it once.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the sign-in sheets and the rota. I need to see who is actually here and who is doing the work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, I’ll check the weekday turnout and the winter social. I need to see why the regulars are hesitating before we lock in a fee.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, fine. I’ll check the bank statements and the ledger. I need to see the actual cash flow, not just the expenses.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
